{"ticker":"TRMB","updated":"2026-11-14T01:29:35Z","profile":{"longName":"Trimble Inc.","shortName":"Trimble Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Scientific & Technical Instruments","country":"United States","website":"https://www.trimble.com","fullTimeEmployees":11500,"marketCap":12755081216,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":13.801247,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.3142993,"pegRatio":1.39,"targetMeanPrice":74.18182,"targetHighPrice":93.0,"targetLowPrice":60.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":11,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.073,"earningsGrowth":-0.457,"grossMargins":0.71576,"operatingMargins":0.17703,"profitMargins":-0.04082,"totalRevenue":3848499968,"beta":1.325,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":84.42,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":47.92,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Trimble Inc. offers technology solutions and platform that enable office professionals and field workers to connect workflows and industry lifecycles in North America, Europe, the Asia Pacific, and internationally. The company provides architecture and interior design; building information modeling, engineering, and virtual design and construction; and construction and owner software products. It also offers field and office software for estimating and job cost management, and project design and visualization; software for 3D design and data sharing; systems to guide and control construction equipment, such as excavators, bulldozers, wheel loaders, motor graders, and paving equipment; systems to monitor, track, and manage assets, equipment, and workers; and software to facilitate the management of the construction process and for sharing and communication of data in real time. In addition, it provides positioning services comprising VRSNow; CenterPoint RTX; FieldPoint RTX; Rangepoint RTX; ViewPoint RTX; and Trimble xFill services. Further, it offers transportation and logistics solutions for shippers, carriers, retailers, and intermediaries, such as carrier transportation management software (TMS) and maintenance solutions to manage core transportation operations and maintenance workflows; transporeon solutions to provide a cloud-based ecosystem that manages the transportation ","summary_zh":"Trimble Inc. 提供技術解決方案和平台，使辦公室專業人員和現場工作人員能夠連接北美、歐洲、亞太地區和國際範圍內的工作流程和產業生命週期。該公司提供建築和室內設計；建築資訊建模、工程以及虛擬設計和施工；以及建築和業主軟體產品。它還提供用於估算和工作成本管理以及專案設計和視覺化的現場和辦公軟體； 3D 設計和資料共享軟體；引導和控制施工設備的系統，例如挖掘機、推土機、輪式裝載機、平地機和鋪路設備；監控、追蹤和管理資產、設備和工人的系統；以及施工過程管理以及即時資料共享和通訊的軟體。此外，它還提供定位服務，包括VRSNow；中心點 RTX； FieldPoint RTX；範圍點 RTX；觀點 RTX；和 Trimble xFill 服務。此外，它還為托運人、承運人、零售商和中間商提供運輸和物流解決方案，例如承運人運輸管理軟體（TMS）和維護解決方案，以管理核心運輸營運和維護工作流程； transporeon 解決方案提供基於雲端的生態系統來管理交通","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"科學技術儀器","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":80.88,"h":82.04,"l":80.56,"c":81.01,"v":981500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":80.9,"h":81.26,"l":80.46,"c":80.89,"v":1191100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":80.99,"h":81.29,"l":78.77,"c":79.64,"v":1146100},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":80.11,"h":81.84,"l":80.03,"c":81.66,"v":1363500},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":82.47,"h":83.18,"l":81.51,"c":82.78,"v":2726700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":82.61,"h":82.62,"l":80.78,"c":82.15,"v":1167800},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":82.28,"h":82.72,"l":81.21,"c":82.04,"v":1187400},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":82.08,"h":82.08,"l":79.71,"c":79.88,"v":1462800},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":79.07,"h":80.09,"l":78.28,"c":79.98,"v":1287500},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":80.3,"h":81.34,"l":79.81,"c":81.24,"v":1043800},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":82.0,"h":82.48,"l":81.55,"c":81.95,"v":2092800},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":81.8,"h":82.28,"l":80.72,"c":81.65,"v":1224900},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":81.06,"h":81.09,"l":78.81,"c":79.41,"v":2293800},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":79.64,"h":80.36,"l":79.27,"c":80.21,"v":1488100},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":80.65,"h":81.33,"l":80.33,"c":80.72,"v":1158800},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":80.99,"h":81.54,"l":80.33,"c":80.81,"v":890500},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":81.38,"h":81.38,"l":79.05,"c":79.3,"v":1126500},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":79.73,"h":81.05,"l":79.43,"c":80.47,"v":1003100},{"t":