m/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxOeTBVWXdtcUR6a3RUQXRoLU8xNzhoZG5yTWR2VEFaQmstdFdTQXhfblVwY1puMWFxemY5WGYtTm10YVBTX0FrNmxfN21HNXRqX2JCenQ1eS14UTg2SHNQZEpqNkU1SDdRaGQxWkQwZ3ZpbTdVMlQwcE9xNS02ZTYxS3NZeXhkT0hiSXNGSDI2ekdFM05lXzc5TDM4OGFaVHU4a1BjdlBqSDVxV0lzU0JFeE9ucmp5WFlsY0ZBQ2VETnhmM1k?oc=5","date":"2026-11-07","zh":"Trimble 股票更新後的指引對股東意味著什麼"},{"title":"Trimble’s Q3 2026 earnings call: our top 5 analyst questions","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQbzROZTVQNlVOVmFkenZRUlloMzBDbGlRNnZkelk5aENNQUN1UC1IaW1seEJKQ2ptN2hkU1h3YWQ0clh3NExKWnR4MVVuSDc2SFlYZDlacTFrMzFKY0tWeHRZRVBJc1Njdmc4N0oybklPdFdkcWhzekpDY3dEcWt6T2ptbkxXM0MyRDlEVGtseVMtUmhwaFdYQ2o0TDBXWWJfeDlyY0ZGOVhYVkRnQW5vaVN1cVd1eTVCVDV6Tg?oc=5","date":"2026-11-06","zh":"Trimble 的 2026 年第三季財報電話會議：分析師提出的 5 大問題"}],"themes":[{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":5},{"name":"財報","count":5},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-25","period":"2026-01-02","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/864749/000086474926000015/trmb-20260102.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Trimble is a leading technology solutions and platform provider, enabling office professionals and field workers to connect their workflows and industry lifecycles, driving a more productive, efficient, and sustainable future. With a focus on the industries that build, maintain, and move the world, the comprehensive depth and breadth of our solutions are transforming the way the world works, making it easier for Trimble customers to focus on what matters—getting the job done right.","zh":null},{"en":"We innovate at the intersection of the digital and physical worlds with solutions that span the world's foundational industries, including building, civil and infrastructure construction, geospatial, natural resources, utilities, and transportation.","zh":null},{"en":"We exist to empower our customers: asset owners; general and specialty contractors; architects, engineers, and designers; surveyors; energy and utility companies; transportation shippers and carriers; as well as state, federal, and municipal governments. Productivity and sustainability are at the heart of who we are—woven into our work internally and through our customers' application of our technologies. Our solutions provide customers with the ability to improve their work quality while being safe, efficient, and sustainable.","zh":null}],"markets":[{"en":"Our segments are distinguished by the markets they serve. Each segment consists of businesses that are responsible for product development, marketing, sales, strategy, and financial performance. We report our financial performance, including revenue and operating income, based on three reportable segments: Architects, Engineers, Construction, and Owners (\"AECO\"), Field Systems, and Transportation and Logistics (\"T&L\"). For further financial information about our segments, see Note 8 \"Segment and Geographic Information\" in Item 8 of this report.","zh":null},{"en":"The AECO segment primarily serves organizations across architecture, engineering, construction, and asset ownership through a connected lifecycle solution. Within this segment, our most substantial product portfolios are focused on architectural and interior design, structural and civil engineering, building and infrastructure construction, and the operations and maintenance of assets. Products are sold through a multi-channel approach, including direct, indirect, and digital channels.","zh":null}],"customers":[{"en":"We continue to opportunistically divest businesses that no longer fit within our strategy. On February 8, 2025, we completed the sale of our global transportation telematics (\"Mobility\") business to Platform Science, Inc. (\"Platform Science\") resulting in our ownership, or rights to acquire ownership of 32.5% of Platform Science's expanded business with an approximate fair value of $253.9 million. The transaction aims to enhance driver experience, fleet safety, efficiency, and compliance by combining two cutting-edge in-cab commercial vehicle ecosystems, which gives customers access to more applications and offerings.","zh":null}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-01-02","items":[{"name":"Field Systems","val":1539500000,"zh":"Field Systems"},{"name":"Architects Engineers Construction & Owners","val":1498600000,"zh":"Architects Engineers Construction & Owners"},{"name":"Transportation & Logistics","val":549200000,"zh":"Transportation & Logistics"}],"total":3587300000},"prod":{"end":"2026-01-02","items":[{"name":"Subscription & Services","val":2452100000,"zh":"Subscription & Services"},{"name":"Product","val":1135200000,"zh":"產品"}],"total":3587300000},"geo":{"end":"2026-01-02","items":[{"name":"North America","val":2075900000,"zh":"North America"},{"name":"US","val":1905800000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Europe","val":1021600000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":349700000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Restof World","val":140100000,"zh":"Restof World"}],"total":3587300000}},"peers":["TDY","PTC","ZBRA","TYL","TER"]}}